            "review_title": "Review at Beach Inside City",
            "review_text": "lethixuan1996\nHoi An, Vietnam9 contributions\n0\ngreat!\nApr 2018 • Friends\nI really loved all the decorations and the design put into hostel! The art pieces and movie posters all looked really neat and interesting. The dorm rooms were clean and each bed came with a big locker and a privacy curtain. The pub on the ground floor has a very nice beer selection and the free breakfast in the morning is pretty good too! It’s very clean and comfortable, the food also super tasty! they have managed to create a unique place with homely atmosphere. They deserve a visit and are well worth five stars!\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 14, 2018",
